      "summary_sent_score": 0.17205461859703064
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Rajat Kumar vs State Of U.P. on 12 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/57026807/\n1 4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1018,
      "end": 1127,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rajat Kumar vs State Of U.P.",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1019,
          "end": 1047
        },
        {
          "text": "12 November, 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1051,
          "end": 1068
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The first bail application of the applicant was rejected by this Court vide order dated 26.07.2023 passed in Crl. Misc. Bail Application No. 32714 of 2023 (Rajat Vs. State of U.P.).\n5.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 1128,
      "end": 1312,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "26.07.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1216,
          "end": 1226
        },
        {
          "text": "Crl. Misc. Bail Application No. 32714 of 2023 (Rajat Vs. State of U.P.",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1237,
          "end": 1307
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2943916916847229
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the applicant submitted that the applicant has been falsely implicated in the present case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1313,
      "end": 1424,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12881454825401306
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "It is submitted that the trial in the present matter has started and the statement of the first informant/Subhash has been recorded as PW-1, copy of the statement has been placed before the Court which is annexure S.A.1 to the supplementary affidavit dated 15.07.2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1425,
      "end": 1693,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Subhash",
          "label": "WITNESS",
          "start": 1531,
          "end": 1538
        },
        {
          "text": "15.07.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1682,
          "end": 1692
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1333826780319214
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Further, learned counsel for the applicant has submitted while placing para nos. 6, 7, 8, 9 and 10 of the said supplementary affidavit that there is a delay in trial and various judgments of the Apex Court hold that the delay in trial violate the fundamental right of a person and as such the applicant be released on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1694,
      "end": 2017,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Apex Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1889,
          "end": 1899
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12204483151435852
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "It is submitted that the first informant in his cross examination has stated that he does not know as to whether the accused persons were present with his son at the time of incident or not.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2018,
      "end": 2208,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18524374067783356
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "It is submitted that as such the applicant be enlarged on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2209,
      "end": 2272,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17847096920013428
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "It is further submitted while placing the judgment of the Apex Court in the case of Ash Mohammad Vs. Shiv Raj Singh @ Lalla Babu and another : (2012) 9 SCC 446, Prabhakar Tewari Vs. State of U.P. and another : (2020) 11 SCC 648 and further of a co-ordinate Bench of this Court passed in Crl. Misc. Bail Application No. 11480 of 2023 (Sumit Awasthi Vs. State of U.P.) decided on 19.07.2023 that the criminal history of an accused cannot be a ground for refusing bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2273,
      "end": 2739,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Apex Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 2331,
          "end": 2341
        },
        {
          "text": "Ash Mohammad Vs. Shiv Raj Singh @ Lalla Babu and another : (2012) 9 SCC 446",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2357,
          "end": 2432
        },
        {
          "text": "Prabhakar Tewari Vs. State of U.P. and another : (2020) 11 SCC 648",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2434,
          "end": 2500
        },
        {
          "text": "Crl. Misc. Bail Application No. 11480 of 2023",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2560,
          "end": 2605
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumit Awasthi Vs. State of U.P.",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2607,
          "end": 2638
        },
        {
          "text": "19.07.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2651,
          "end": 2661
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3235304653644562
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "It is submitted that as such the bail be granted.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2740,
      "end": 2789,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19042491912841797
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The applicant is in jail since 18.04.2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2790,
      "end": 2832,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "18.04.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2821,
          "end": 2831
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20852617919445038
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "6. Per contra, learned counsel for the State opposed the prayer for bail and submitted that the first bail application of the applicant has been rejected by a detailed order on merits by this Court on 26.07.2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 2834,
      "end": 3046,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "26.07.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3035,
          "end": 3045
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10821502655744553
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "It is submitted that the trial in the present matter is going on in which one witness has been examined who has supported the prosecution case and as such it cannot be said that the trial is not in progress.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3047,
      "end": 3254,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19658100605010986
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "It is further submitted that the applicant reported to be having a criminal history of 11 cases and the cases are heinous in nature.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3255,
      "end": 3387,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19424527883529663
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "The said fact was also considered while deciding the first bail application of the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3388,
      "end": 3481,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23322513699531555
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "It is submitted that there is no fresh and new ground in the present bail application and as such the present bail application of the applicant be rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3482,
      "end": 3638,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17215131223201752
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "7. After having heard learned counsels for the parties and perusing the records, it is evident that the first bail application of the applicant has been rejected by this Court vide order dated 26.07.2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3639,
      "end": 3844,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "26.07.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3833,
          "end": 3843
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.146711528301239
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "The same reads as under:\n\"1. Heard Sri Bhuvnesh Kumar Singh, learned counsel for the applicant and Sri Virendra Pratap Singh, learned counsel for the State and perused the material on record.\n2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3846,
      "end": 4040,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bhuvnesh Kumar Singh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
