    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "3. The first information report of the present case was lodged on 16.04.2023 by Subhash under Sections 306 IPC against the applicant, co-accused Rajat, Jitendra @\nRajat Kumar vs State Of U.P. on 12 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/57026807/\n2 Tata, Raja, Junaid, Mustafa, alleging therein that his son Satyam lives in Bijnor.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4320,
      "end": 4671,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "16.04.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 4386,
