      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20623107254505157
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 45,
      "text": "5. Per contra, learned counsel for the State vehemently opposed the prayer for bail and argued that the applicant is named in the first information report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 6561,
      "end": 6716,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19205717742443085
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 46,
      "text": "The applicant has criminal history of 11 cases apart from the present case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 6717,
      "end": 6792,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2188824862241745
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 47,
      "text": "It is argued that there is one other case under the Goondas Act which has neither been disclosed nor explained in the criminal history of the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 6793,
      "end": 6945,
      "entities": [
