    {
      "sentence_id": 57,
      "text": "6. It is argued that co-accused who have been granted bail were not having any criminal history as is evident from the order passed in the bail applications and as such the case of the applicant is distinguishable with that of co-accused.\n6.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 8554,
      "end": 8795,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.051017988473176956
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 58,
      "text": "After having heard learned counsel for the parties and perusing the record, it is evident that the applicant is named in the first information report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 8796,
      "end": 8946,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.038785312324762344
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 59,
      "text": "The applicant has criminal history of 11 cases apart from the present case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 8947,
      "end": 9022,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.054695695638656616
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 60,
      "text": "Co-accused who have been granted bail were not having any criminal history.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 9023,
      "end": 9098,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07067108154296875
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 61,
      "text": "7. Looking to the facts and circumstances of the case and long criminal history of the applicant, this Court does not find it a fit case for bail, hence, the bail application is rejected.\"",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 9099,
      "end": 9288,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.060280267149209976
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 62,
      "text": "8. The trial in the present matter is going in which one witness has been examined, it cannot be said that the trial is not under progress.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 9290,
      "end": 9429,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24224205315113068
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 63,
      "text": "In so far as the ground of criminal antecedents are concerned,\nthe same were considered while rejecting the first bail application of the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 9430,
      "end": 9578,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4608120620250702
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 64,
      "text": "The earlier involvement of the applicant in various other cases goes to show that the cases are different in nature which show his involvement in criminal activity.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 9579,
      "end": 9743,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5174354314804077
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 65,
      "text": "I do not find it a fit case for bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 9744,
      "end": 9781,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2675027549266815
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 66,
      "text": "9. Considering the totality of the case in particular, nature of evidence available on record, I am not inclined to release the applicant on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 9783,
      "end": 9929,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24747255444526672
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 67,
      "text": "Rajat Kumar vs State Of U.P. on 12 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/57026807/\n4 10.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 9930,
      "end": 10040,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rajat Kumar vs State Of U.P.",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 9931,
          "end": 9959
        },
        {
          "text": "12 November, 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 9963,
          "end": 9980
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 68,
      "text": "The present bail application is, accordingly, rejected.",
